{"seq":2,"slug":"simulation-modeling-tools","title":"模拟建模工具：Vensim、Stella、PySD 与 Agent-Based Modeling","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/systems-thinking-software/practice/simulation-modeling-tools","wordCount":1710,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"模拟建模工具-vensim-stella-pysd-与-agent-based-modeling\">模拟建模工具：Vensim、Stella、PySD 与 Agent-Based Modeling</h1><p>系统映射工作坊产出定性的因果回路图，而模拟建模工具将定性的系统结构转化为可以运行的量化模型。「运行模型」的意义在于：复杂系统的行为往往违反直觉，人类的大脑不擅长追踪多个反馈回路同时作用时的结果，而计算机模拟可以精确地展示系统在不同参数条件下的演化轨迹。</p>\n<p>本文覆盖系统动力学领域主要的建模工具，并提供选型指南和上手路径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>授权</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Vensim</td>\n<td>系统动力学 SD</td>\n<td>标准 SD 模型，学术研究，与他人分享</td>\n<td>专业版付费，PLE 免费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stella</td>\n<td>系统动力学 SD</td>\n<td>教学演示，交互式展示给非技术受众</td>\n<td>付费（有试用期）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PySD</td>\n<td>Python + SD</td>\n<td>与数据科学集成，结合真实数据分析</td>\n<td>开源免费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mesa</td>\n<td>Agent-Based Modeling</td>\n<td>个体差异、空间结构、涌现行为研究</td>\n<td>开源免费</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A{建模目标} --&gt;|理解聚合层次动态| B[系统动力学\\nVensim / Stella / PySD]&#10;    A --&gt;|研究个体行为涌现| C[Agent-Based Modeling\\nMesa]&#10;    B --&gt;|标准工具需求| D[Vensim PLE]&#10;    B --&gt;|Python 数据分析集成| E[PySD + Jupyter]&#10;    B --&gt;|教学与交互演示| F[Stella Online]\">flowchart TD\n    A{建模目标} --&gt;|理解聚合层次动态| B[系统动力学\\nVensim / Stella / PySD]\n    A --&gt;|研究个体行为涌现| C[Agent-Based Modeling\\nMesa]\n    B --&gt;|标准工具需求| D[Vensim PLE]\n    B --&gt;|Python 数据分析集成| E[PySD + Jupyter]\n    B --&gt;|教学与交互演示| F[Stella Online]</pre><h2 id=\"工具概览\">工具概览</h2><h3 id=\"vensim-系统动力学标准工具\">Vensim（系统动力学标准工具）</h3><p>Vensim 是 Ventana Systems 开发的商业系统动力学软件，是学术界和咨询界使用最广泛的系统动力学工具之一。Meadows 的《系统之美》中的很多模型就是用 Vensim 构建的。</p>\n<p><strong>核心特性</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>可视化的存量流量图绘制界面</li>\n<li>内置方程编辑器（Vensim 方程语言）</li>\n<li>实时仿真与参数灵敏度分析</li>\n<li>Reality Check（验证内置逻辑一致性）</li>\n<li>SyntheSim（实时调参观察响应）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>使用场景</strong>：需要标准系统动力学模型的场景，与其他系统动力学从业者分享模型，学术研究。</p>\n<p><strong>授权</strong>：专业版付费，个人学习版（PLE）免费。</p>\n<p><strong>入门路径</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>下载 Vensim PLE（免费）</li>\n<li>完成内置的 Tutorial（约 4 小时）</li>\n<li>用 Vensim 重建第 2 章技术债模型的 SFD</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"stella-architect-stella-online\">Stella Architect / Stella Online</h3><p>Stella（isee systems 开发）是 Vensim 的主要竞品，界面更友好，学习曲线较低。Stella Online 版可以在浏览器中直接运行，无需安装。</p>\n<p><strong>核心特性</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>更友好的可视化界面</li>\n<li>内置「Flight Simulator」模式：用户可以拖动滑块实时干预模型参数，模拟不同决策的效果</li>\n<li>适合教学和展示</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>使用场景</strong>：教学演示、需要交互式展示给非技术受众。</p>\n<p><strong>授权</strong>：付费，有试用期。</p>\n<h3 id=\"python-pysd\">Python PySD</h3><p>PySD 是 James Houghton 开发的开源 Python 库，可以读取并运行 Vensim 和 Stella 格式的模型，也支持直接用 Python 构建系统动力学模型。</p>\n<p><strong>核心优势</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>完全开源免费</li>\n<li>与 Python 数据科学生态集成（pandas、numpy、matplotlib、jupyter）</li>\n<li>可以将系统动力学模型与真实数据结合（用历史数据校准参数）</li>\n<li>适合自动化分析和大规模情景模拟</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>安装与基本使用</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"pip install pysd\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pip</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pysd</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>用 PySD 构建一个简单的技术债模型</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import pysd&#10;import numpy as np&#10;import matplotlib.pyplot as plt&#10;&#10;# 手动构建一个简单模型（PySD 也支持导入 Vensim 文件）&#10;# 存量：tech_debt（技术债存量，初始值 10）&#10;# 流量：debt_intro_rate（债务引入率），debt_reduction_rate（偿还率）&#10;&#10;def simulate_tech_debt(&#10;    initial_debt=10,       # 初始技术债（单位：功能周）&#10;    base_intro_rate=2,     # 每 Sprint 基础引入率&#10;    pressure_factor=1.5,   # 压力系数：压力大时引入率倍增&#10;    max_dev_speed=10,      # 最大开发速度&#10;    debt_capacity=50,      # 债务容量（超过时开发速度归零）&#10;    refactor_fraction=0.2, # 可用于偿还债务的开发时间比例&#10;    sprints=52             # 模拟周期&#10;):&#10;    tech_debt = initial_debt&#10;    history = [tech_debt]&#10;&#10;    for sprint in range(sprints):&#10;        # 开发速度随技术债非线性下降&#10;        dev_speed = max_dev_speed * max(0, 1 - (tech_debt / debt_capacity) ** 1.5)&#10;&#10;        # 债务引入率（压力越大，走捷径越多）&#10;        pressure = max_dev_speed / max(dev_speed, 0.1)  # 压力 = 期望速度 / 实际速度&#10;        intro_rate = base_intro_rate * min(pressure_factor, pressure)&#10;&#10;        # 偿还率（受可用时间限制）&#10;        reduction_rate = dev_speed * refactor_fraction&#10;&#10;        # 更新存量&#10;        net_change = intro_rate - reduction_rate&#10;        tech_debt = max(0, tech_debt + net_change)&#10;        history.append(tech_debt)&#10;&#10;    return history&#10;&#10;# 情景对比：高重构投入 vs 低重构投入&#10;no_refactor = simulate_tech_debt(refactor_fraction=0.05)&#10;moderate_refactor = simulate_tech_debt(refactor_fraction=0.20)&#10;aggressive_refactor = simulate_tech_debt(refactor_fraction=0.35)&#10;&#10;plt.figure(figsize=(10, 6))&#10;plt.plot(no_refactor, label=&#39;无重构（5%时间）&#39;, color=&#39;red&#39;)&#10;plt.plot(moderate_refactor, label=&#39;适度重构（20%时间）&#39;, color=&#39;orange&#39;)&#10;plt.plot(aggressive_refactor, label=&#39;积极重构（35%时间）&#39;, color=&#39;green&#39;)&#10;plt.xlabel(&#39;Sprint 数量&#39;)&#10;plt.ylabel(&#39;技术债积累量&#39;)&#10;plt.title(&#39;不同重构策略下的技术债演化&#39;)&#10;plt.legend()&#10;plt.grid(True)&#10;plt.axhline(y=50, color=&#39;black&#39;, linestyle=&#39;--&#39;, label=&#39;崩溃阈值&#39;)&#10;plt.show()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pysd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> matplotlib.pyplot </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> plt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 手动构建一个简单模型（PySD 也支持导入 Vensim 文件）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 存量：tech_debt（技术债存量，初始值 10）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 流量：debt_intro_rate（债务引入率），debt_reduction_rate（偿还率）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> simulate_tech_debt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    initial_debt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 初始技术债（单位：功能周）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    base_intro_rate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 每 Sprint 基础引入率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    pressure_factor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 压力系数：压力大时引入率倍增</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    max_dev_speed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 最大开发速度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    debt_capacity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 债务容量（超过时开发速度归零）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    refactor_fraction</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 可用于偿还债务的开发时间比例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sprints</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">52</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">             # 模拟周期</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tech_debt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> initial_debt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    history </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [tech_debt]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sprint </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sprints):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 开发速度随技术债非线性下降</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        dev_speed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> max_dev_speed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (tech_debt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> debt_capacity) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 债务引入率（压力越大，走捷径越多）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        pressure </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> max_dev_speed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(dev_speed, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 压力 = 期望速度 / 实际速度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        intro_rate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base_intro_rate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(pressure_factor, pressure)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 偿还率（受可用时间限制）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        reduction_rate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dev_speed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> refactor_fraction</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 更新存量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        net_change </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> intro_rate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reduction_rate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        tech_debt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, tech_debt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> net_change)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        history.append(tech_debt)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> history</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 情景对比：高重构投入 vs 低重构投入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">no_refactor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> simulate_tech_debt(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">refactor_fraction</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.05</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">moderate_refactor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> simulate_tech_debt(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">refactor_fraction</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">aggressive_refactor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> simulate_tech_debt(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">refactor_fraction</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.35</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">plt.figure(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">figsize</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">plt.plot(no_refactor, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">label</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'无重构（5%时间）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">color</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'red'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">plt.plot(moderate_refactor, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">label</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'适度重构（20%时间）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">color</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'orange'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">plt.plot(aggressive_refactor, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">label</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'积极重构（35%时间）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">color</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'green'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">plt.xlabel(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Sprint 数量'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">plt.ylabel(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'技术债积累量'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">plt.title(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'不同重构策略下的技术债演化'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">plt.legend()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">plt.grid(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">plt.axhline(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">y</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">color</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'black'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">linestyle</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'--'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">label</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'崩溃阈值'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">plt.show()</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个模型虽然简化，但可以揭示一个反直觉的洞见：<strong>在高压项目初期，即使只投入 20% 的时间用于重构，长期的技术债积累量也可能远低于不重构的情况</strong>，因为重构维持了开发速度，减少了由「速度慢→压力大→走捷径」增强回路产生的债务。</p>\n<h3 id=\"agent-based-modeling-abm-mesa\">Agent-Based Modeling (ABM)：Mesa</h3><p>系统动力学（Vensim/PySD）描述的是<strong>聚合层次</strong>的系统行为——所有工程师、所有服务被视为集合，用平均行为建模。Agent-Based Modeling（ABM）则描述<strong>个体层次</strong>——每个 Agent（工程师、服务、请求）有自己的状态和行为规则，系统行为从个体交互中涌现出来。</p>\n<p>ABM 适合以下场景：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>个体之间的差异性很重要（不同工程师的技能水平、不同服务的延迟分布）</li>\n<li>空间结构很重要（服务网格拓扑对故障传播的影响）</li>\n<li>涌现行为的机制需要被理解（代码审查文化如何从个体行为中涌现出来）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Mesa</strong>（Python）是最常用的开源 ABM 框架：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"pip install mesa\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pip</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mesa</span></span></code></pre></div><p>一个简化的代码审查文化传播模型（示意）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from mesa import Agent, Model&#10;from mesa.time import RandomActivation&#10;from mesa.space import NetworkGrid&#10;import networkx as nx&#10;&#10;class EngineerAgent(Agent):&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;一个工程师 Agent&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;&#10;    def __init__(self, unique_id, model, quality_standard=0.5):&#10;        super().__init__(unique_id, model)&#10;        self.quality_standard = quality_standard  # 代码质量要求（0-1）&#10;&#10;    def step(self):&#10;        # 每步：受邻居（协作者）影响，调整自己的质量标准&#10;        neighbors = self.model.grid.get_neighbors(self.pos, include_center=False)&#10;        if neighbors:&#10;            neighbor_standards = [n.quality_standard for n in neighbors if isinstance(n, EngineerAgent)]&#10;            if neighbor_standards:&#10;                avg_neighbor_standard = sum(neighbor_standards) / len(neighbor_standards)&#10;                # 缓慢向邻居均值移动（社会影响）&#10;                self.quality_standard += 0.1 * (avg_neighbor_standard - self.quality_standard)&#10;&#10;class TeamModel(Model):&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;一个工程团队模型&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;&#10;    def __init__(self, n_engineers=20, network_type=&#39;small_world&#39;):&#10;        self.num_agents = n_engineers&#10;        self.schedule = RandomActivation(self)&#10;&#10;        # 创建网络（表示协作关系）&#10;        if network_type == &#39;small_world&#39;:&#10;            G = nx.watts_strogatz_graph(n_engineers, k=4, p=0.3)&#10;&#10;        self.grid = NetworkGrid(G)&#10;&#10;        # 创建 Agent&#10;        for i, node in enumerate(G.nodes()):&#10;            # 初始：10% 的工程师有高质量标准，90% 有低标准&#10;            initial_standard = 0.9 if i &lt; n_engineers * 0.1 else 0.2&#10;            engineer = EngineerAgent(i, self, quality_standard=initial_standard)&#10;            self.schedule.add(engineer)&#10;            self.grid.place_agent(engineer, node)&#10;&#10;    def step(self):&#10;        self.schedule.step()&#10;&#10;    def average_quality_standard(self):&#10;        return sum(a.quality_standard for a in self.schedule.agents) / self.num_agents\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mesa </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Agent, Model</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mesa.time </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> RandomActivation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mesa.space </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NetworkGrid</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> networkx </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> EngineerAgent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Agent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"一个工程师 Agent\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, unique_id, model, quality_standard</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(unique_id, model)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.quality_standard </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quality_standard  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 代码质量要求（0-1）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> step</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 每步：受邻居（协作者）影响，调整自己的质量标准</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        neighbors </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.model.grid.get_neighbors(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pos, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">include_center</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> neighbors:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            neighbor_standards </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [n.quality_standard </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> neighbors </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> isinstance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n, EngineerAgent)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> neighbor_standards:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                avg_neighbor_standard </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(neighbor_standards) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(neighbor_standards)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                # 缓慢向邻居均值移动（社会影响）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">                self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.quality_standard </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (avg_neighbor_standard </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.quality_standard)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TeamModel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Model</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"一个工程团队模型\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, n_engineers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, network_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'small_world'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.num_agents </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n_engineers</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.schedule </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> RandomActivation(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 创建网络（表示协作关系）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> network_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'small_world'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            G </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nx.watts_strogatz_graph(n_engineers, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">k</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">p</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.grid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NetworkGrid(G)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 创建 Agent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i, node </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> enumerate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(G.nodes()):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            # 初始：10% 的工程师有高质量标准，90% 有低标准</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            initial_standard </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.9</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n_engineers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> else</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            engineer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> EngineerAgent(i, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">quality_standard</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">initial_standard)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.schedule.add(engineer)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.grid.place_agent(engineer, node)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> step</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.schedule.step()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> average_quality_standard</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(a.quality_standard </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.schedule.agents) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.num_agents</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个模型可以回答：在一个有小世界网络结构（少数连接节点）的团队中，如果只有 10% 的工程师有高质量标准，这种文化会传播开来，还是会被稀释？仿真结果通常表明，初始高标准工程师的<strong>位置</strong>（是否是网络中的连接节点）比数量更重要——这是一个用语言无法清晰推理的涌现结论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工具选型指南\">工具选型指南</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>需求场景</th>\n<th>推荐工具</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>学习系统动力学基础</td>\n<td>Vensim PLE（免费版）</td>\n<td>业界标准，学习资源丰富</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>向非技术受众展示</td>\n<td>Stella Online</td>\n<td>交互式 Flight Simulator 界面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>与数据分析集成</td>\n<td>PySD + Jupyter</td>\n<td>Python 生态，可结合真实数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>个体行为与涌现研究</td>\n<td>Mesa（ABM）</td>\n<td>聚合模型无法捕捉的个体层次动态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>教学与课堂</td>\n<td>isee Exchange（Stella 模型分享平台）</td>\n<td>大量预建模型可直接使用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"建模实践的注意事项\">建模实践的注意事项</h2><p><strong>模型的目的是理解，不是预测</strong>：系统动力学模型不是精确预测未来的工具（参数不确定性太大），而是帮助理解「系统在不同结构下会产生什么样的行为模式」。一个发现「只要重构比例低于 X%，技术债就会失控」的模型，即使参数不精确，对决策也有指导价值。</p>\n<p><strong>先简后繁</strong>：从最小化的模型开始（3-5 个变量），验证基本逻辑正确后再添加复杂性。一个有 50 个变量的「精确」模型，往往不如一个有 8 个变量的「清晰」模型更有说服力。</p>\n<p><strong>敏感性分析</strong>：对于不确定的参数（如「重构对技术债的影响系数」），运行多次情景分析，观察结论对参数变化是否鲁棒。如果结论在参数的合理范围内都成立，可信度高；如果结论只在非常窄的参数区间成立，要谨慎。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Vensim（专业标准）、Stella（教学友好）、PySD（Python 集成）用于系统动力学建模；Mesa 用于基于 Agent 的建模</li>\n<li>系统动力学模型的目的是理解系统结构的行为模式，不是精确预测</li>\n<li>PySD 与 Python 数据科学生态集成，可以结合真实数据进行参数校准和情景分析</li>\n<li>Mesa ABM 适合研究涌现行为，个体差异性和空间结构对系统行为有重要影响时使用</li>\n<li>建模原则：从简单模型开始，验证逻辑后再扩展，对不确定参数做敏感性分析</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"模拟建模工具：Vensim、Stella、PySD 与 Agent-Based Modeling","id":"模拟建模工具-vensim-stella-pysd-与-agent-based-modeling"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"工具概览","id":"工具概览"},{"level":3,"text":"Vensim（系统动力学标准工具）","id":"vensim-系统动力学标准工具"},{"level":3,"text":"Stella Architect / Stella Online","id":"stella-architect-stella-online"},{"level":3,"text":"Python PySD","id":"python-pysd"},{"level":3,"text":"Agent-Based Modeling (ABM)：Mesa","id":"agent-based-modeling-abm-mesa"},{"level":2,"text":"工具选型指南","id":"工具选型指南"},{"level":2,"text":"建模实践的注意事项","id":"建模实践的注意事项"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"系统映射工作坊：团队 CLD 绘制的 Facilitator 指南","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/systems-thinking-software/practice/systems-mapping-workshop"},"next":{"title":"组织学习与心智模型：Senge 学习型组织在工程团队中的实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/systems-thinking-software/practice/organizational-learning"}}